{"suttaId":"tha-ap443","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-ii","vriCode":"s0510m2.mul","paras":[818,841],"vripara":"1"},"segments":{"tha-ap443:0.3":"Vibhītakamiñjiyattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap443:1.1":"“Kakusandho mahāvīro, sabbadhammāna pāragū;","tha-ap443:1.3":"Gaṇamhā vūpakaṭṭho so, agamāsi vanantaraṃ.","tha-ap443:2.1":"“Bījamiñjaṃ gahetvāna, latāya āvuṇiṃ ahaṃ;","tha-ap443:2.3":"Bhagavā tamhi samaye, jhāyate pabbatantare.","tha-ap443:3.1":"“Disvānahaṃ devadevaṃ, vippasannena cetasā;","tha-ap443:3.3":"Dakkhiṇeyyassa vīrassa, bījamiñjamadāsahaṃ.","tha-ap443:4.1":"“Imasmiṃyeva kappamhi, yaṃ miñjamadadiṃ [phalamadadiṃ (sī. pī.), bījamadadiṃ (syā.)] tadā;","tha-ap443:4.3":"Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi, bījamiñjassidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap443:5.1":"“Kilesā jhāpitā mayhaṃ, bhavā sabbe samūhatā;","tha-ap443:5.3":"Nāgova bandhanaṃ chetvā, viharāmi anāsavo.","tha-ap443:6.1":"“Svāgataṃ vata me āsi, mama buddhassa santike;","tha-ap443:6.3":"Tisso vijjā anuppattā, kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ.","tha-ap443:7.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso, vimokkhāpi ca aṭṭhime;","tha-ap443:7.3":"Chaḷabhiññā sacchikatā, kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap443:8.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā vibhītakamiñjiyo [vibhedaka …(syā. ka.)] thero imā Gāthāyo abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap443:9.1":"Vibhītakamiñjiyattherassāpadānaṃ paṭhamaṃ."},"attha":null,"tika":null,"tika2":null}
